OL,3,GNEWSAMan and woman appear in court
OL,4,Afollowing arson attack deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a woman have appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt, charged in connection with a
OL,8,Ffatal arson attack in Waterford in the
OL,9,FRepublic of Ireland.
OL,11,FCian Stacey, 21, of no fixed abode, and
OL,12,FJessica Dalton, 31, with an address in
OL,13,FWaterford city, are both charged with
OL,14,FSection 4 assault causing serious harm
OL,15,Fagainst two individuals, who cannot be
OL,16,Fnamed for legal reasons, and criminal
OL,17,Fdamage.
OL,19,FDetectives said that neither person
OL,20,Fmade any reply when the charges were
OL,21,Fput to them.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
